<!--
  Source: GET /sap/bc/adt/atc/checkvariants/formtemplate?chkvName=DEFAULT
  (a live S/4 system, read-only capture, 2026-10-21)

  Sanitized: the customer-owned check category and its checks were renamed
  to ZEXAMPLE_* and their descriptions paraphrased; SAP-standard
  categories, checks, implementing classes and parameters are unchanged.
  Truncated to three categories (CI_PERFORMANCE, CI_SECURITY, and the
  sanitized custom category) to keep the fixture small; the retained check
  entries keep their full real shape (parameters, parameterValueXml,
  documentation/technicalsettings links).

  The check variant form template is the ATC check catalog: each
  availableCheckCategory lists its checks, and each check's
  implementingClass name is the implementing class; live worklist findings
  carry a GUID checkId that is resolved to this class via the documentation
  page (the bundled atc/worklist.xml fixture uses class-like checkIds for
  direct-lookup tests).
-->
